		시드니는 <<his>> 고개를 숙인 채, 당신의 <<if _acceptMessage>>깨달음을<<else>>생각을<</if>> 알지 못한다.
<</switch>>
<<npcincr Sydney purity 1>><<gspurity>>
<br><br>

<<if $stress gte $stressmax>>
	<<passouttempleSydney>>
<<elseif $phase isnot 2 and $phase isnot 3 and random(1, 2) is 1 and $phase isnot 10>>
	<<set $purityEvent to 1>>
	시드니가 <<his>> 눈을 뜨고 당신을 마주 본다. "그래서, 무엇을 위해 기도하고 계셨나요?"
	<br><br>
	<<switch $phase>>
		<<case 2>>
			<<link [[말한다|Temple Sydney Pray Tell]]>><<npcincr Sydney love 1>><<npcincr Sydney purity 2>><</link>><<glove>><<gspurity>>
			<br>
		<<case 3>>
			<<link [[말한다|Temple Sydney Pray Tell]]>><<npcincr Sydney purity -2>><</link>><<lspurity>><<sydneyWarning>>
			<br>
		<<case 4 5 6 7 8 9 10>>
			<<if _acceptMessage>>
				<<link [[말한다|Temple Sydney Pray Tell Acceptance]]>><<stress -6>><<trauma -6>><</link>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
				<br>
			<<else>>
				<<link [[말한다|Temple Sydney Pray Tell]]>><<npcincr Sydney purity -5>><</link>><<llspurity>><<gacceptance>><<promiscuous1>><<sydneyWarning>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
	<</switch>>
	<<link [[말하지 않는다|Temple Sydney Pray Quiet]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif dangerEvent() and $eventskip isnot 1>>
	<<if $rng gte 81>>
		<<set $sydneyPresent to true>>
		<<generateTemple 2>><<person2>> 헌금 접시를 든 <<monk>>【이가】 지나간다. <<He>>【은는】 당신에게 미소 짓는다.
		<br><br>

